<Legal title="Refund and cancellation policy" description="Cancel any time. Paid plans are not refunded, except where the law requires it or we charged you in error." updated="Last updated: 25 November 2026">
  <h2>Cancel any time</h2>
  <p>You can cancel your subscription at any time. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period, and you keep access until then.</p>

  <h2>No refunds</h2>
  <p>Paid plans are not refunded, except where the law requires a refund.</p>

  <h2>Charges made in error</h2>
  <p>If we charge you in error, we refund the error.</p>

  <h2>How to ask</h2>
  <p>If you think a charge is wrong, write to <a href="mailto:support@alphawavesystems.com">support@alphawavesystems.com</a> from the email address of your account and tell us which charge you mean.</p>
</Legal>
